<h1 data-copy-en="Torea" data-copy-zh="Torea">Torea</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Torea’s schedule, linked personal milestones, three heart-to-hearts and dates." data-copy-zh="Torea的日程、共同个人里程碑、三段谈心与约会。">Torea’s schedule, linked personal milestones, three heart-to-hearts and dates.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Torea</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Shared_Food_Court_Event"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Additional_Shared_Appearances"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Win_Her_a_Prize_.E2.80.94_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Win_Her_a_Prize_—_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Boardwalk_After_Sunset_.E2.80.94_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Boardwalk_After_Sunset_—_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Fair_Date_.E2.80.94_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Fair_Date_—_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Dates_and_Exact_Start_Windows"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="A_Claim_Answered"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="A_Larger_Night"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Shape_of_Appetite"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Heart-to-Hearts_and_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Five_Minutes_of_Night_.E2.80.94_Seven_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Five_Minutes_of_Night_—_Seven_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Personal_and_Shared_Event_Gates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Torea — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/torea.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Torea — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/torea.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Torea — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Torea’s ordinary meetings open after Story 61. Her personal route alternates between daytime Present venues and evening rooms, with several steps depending on Helsa’s progress. This guide gives the required visits and relationship stages without describing their discoveries.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Stats.2C_Unlock_and_Daily_Schedule"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Stats,_Unlock_and_Daily_Schedule"></span><h2>Where to find Torea</h2><p>Visit the University Classroom (Uptown) 09:00–14:00, mall Food Court 14:00–18:00, Torea’s Room 18:00–23:00, or Downtown Back Alley 00:00–04:00. All four ordinary portraits need Story 61. The library-basement route leads to the rooms used by her evening events.</p><p>For the evening room, go through Present Uptown → City Library → Library Basement → Dark Corridor → Vampire Lair → Torea’s Room. The private rooms branch directly from the lair’s main hall.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">University Classroom</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">09:00–14:00</td><td data-label="Condition">after Story 61</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Food Court (Mall)</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Condition">after Story 61</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Torea's Chamber</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Condition">after Story 61</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Back Alley</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">00:00–04:00</td><td data-label="Condition">after Story 61</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Route_Order"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Start with The Hunt in Neon at Acknowledged (10), 19:00–22:00 in her room, then visit the alley 00:00–03:00 for the next step. Fair Date needs Friend (100) and The Hunt Arrives; it starts at the school 11:00–14:00.</p><p>The first heart-to-heart follows Fair Date at Friend. Continue the shared personal objectives with Helsa, then the lounge encounter, second heart-to-heart and Boardwalk date. The third heart-to-heart requires the later shared nighttime encounter. The reference table keeps their location and timing checks separate.</p><details><summary>Automatic encounters: complete start conditions</summary><p>Enter the indicated location during its scene window. These encounters complete once; fixed base relationship rewards below are separate from choice bonuses. A missing hour restriction means the scene itself has no extra clock gate.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Encounter</th><th scope="col">Start location / hours</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Fixed base relationship</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Shape of Hunger</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Carmilla's Chamber; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Torea Acquaintance (50); after Lady Carmilla</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Lady Carmilla +5 / Torea +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Hunt in Neon</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Torea's Chamber; 19:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Torea Acknowledged (10); after Story 61</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Torea +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Scent of Silver</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Back Alley; 00:00–03:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">after The Hunt in Neon</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Torea +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Loose the Cat</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Torea's Chamber; 19:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Torea Friend (100); Helsa Friend (100); after Fair Date with Torea / Helsa’s preceding personal milestone (follow Objectives) / The Shape of Appetite / The Hunter I Chose</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Torea +8 / Helsa +8 / Diedra +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Teeth With Ribbons</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Vampire Lounge; 18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Loose the Cat</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Torea +14 / Diedra +8 / Lady Carmilla +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Blood Owed, Blood Chosen</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Torea's Chamber; 19:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Torea Close Friend (200); after Boardwalk After Sunset / A Hunter Bleeds / A Larger Night; Becky available for the meeting</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Torea +18 / Helsa +6 / Officer Becky +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Five Minutes of Night</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Back Alley; 21:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Torea Close Friend (200); Helsa Close Friend (200); after Blood Owed, Blood Chosen / The Arrow She Does Not Loose / A Larger Night / The Long Pursuit</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Torea +25 / Helsa +25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Vampire's Claim</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Torea's Chamber; 19:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Torea Romantic (800); after Five Minutes of Night / A Claim Answered</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Torea +30</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Quiet Chapter</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">City Library (Uptown); 08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">after Story 100</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Something Sweeter</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Food Court (Mall); 14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Katie Friend (100); Torea Friend (100); after Story 61</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Causal Window</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Vampire Laboratory; any hour</td><td data-label="Requirements">Torea Acquaintance (50); after Magistra Ruxandra</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Magistra Ruxandra +8 / Torea +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Hunt Arrives</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Back Alley; 01:00–04:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">after The Scent of Silver</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Helsa +10 / Torea +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Student of Monsters</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">University Hall; odd days, 09:00–13:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Helsa Acknowledged (10); after The Hunt Arrives</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Helsa +10 / Torea +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Arrow She Does Not Loose</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Back Alley; 21:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Helsa Close Friend (200); after Stargazing with Helsa / Teeth With Ribbons / The Long Pursuit</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Helsa +18 / Torea +7</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Fair Date</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Classroom; 11:00–14:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after The Hunt Arrives</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $150; −45 Energy</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Win Her a Prize</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Classroom; 12:00–14:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); not currently pregnant</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; Voucher ×1</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Shape of Appetite</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Torea's Chamber; 18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after Fair Date with Torea</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">75 min; −15 Energy; +5 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Larger Night</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Torea's Chamber; 20:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Teeth With Ribbons / The Shape of Appetite</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; −20 Energy; +10 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Boardwalk After Sunset</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Torea's Chamber; 18:00–20:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Teeth With Ribbons / A Larger Night</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">120 min; $100; −35 Energy; +10 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Claim Answered</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Torea's Chamber; 20:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); after Five Minutes of Night / A Larger Night</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">90 min; −15 Energy; +15 Calm</td><td data-label="Result / limit">heart-to-heart; once</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Talk costs 20 minutes and gives 1 base relationship point, with three safe uses shared across all four locations. Voucher Fair is a separate once-only date from the school: the effective start window is 12:00–14:00, not the action’s full afternoon range.</p><p>The three heart-to-hearts cost 75, 90 and 90 minutes respectively. The evening ones start 20:00–22:00. The Boardwalk date starts from her room 18:00–20:00 and costs 120 minutes, $100 and 35 Energy, restoring 10 Calm.</p><p>After Story 61, Crush (400) also qualifies Torea for KTV and Night Club invitations, 20:00–23:00. Each venue permits one invitation daily shared across its guests. These invitations are separate from the personal date chain.</p><p>Relationship rewards are base values unless marked direct. Shared relationship modifiers affect the final gain. Repeated actions keep their daily allowance when you meet the same character elsewhere.</p><details><summary>Relationship bonuses</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Type</th><th scope="col">Reference</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Favorite stats</th><td data-label="Reference">Charm 120 / Intelligence 130 / Mystic 110</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Relationship skill</th><td data-label="Reference">Anthropology</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Favorite-stat contribution scales toward the listed values. The relationship skill affects the shared relationship multiplier; it is not automatically a skill taught by this character.</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Torea</th><td data-label="Location / start window">University Classroom; 09:00–14:00<br/>Food Court (Mall); 14:00–18:00<br/>Torea's Chamber; 18:00–23:00<br/>Back Alley; 00:00–04:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +1; 3 safe uses/day</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>Heart-to-heart reward reference</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Conversation</th><th scope="col">Best ordinary base total</th><th scope="col">Useful special replies</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Shape of Appetite</th><td data-label="Best ordinary base total">72</td><td data-label="Useful special replies">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Larger Night</th><td data-label="Best ordinary base total">88</td><td data-label="Useful special replies">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Claim Answered</th><td data-label="Best ordinary base total">108</td><td data-label="Useful special replies">—</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>These totals describe the best ordinary choices, before relationship modifiers. A special reply can improve the reward; it is not required just to finish the conversation. Romantic adds 25 final relationship points on completion.</p></details></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting_and_Current_Scope"></span><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>An automatic nighttime encounter can have a different window from the normal alley portrait. If a later personal action is missing, check Helsa’s current Objectives and completed conversations as well as Torea’s stage.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships, dates and intimacy</a> · <a href="character-helsa.html">Helsa</a> · <a href="locations.html">Locations</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Shared_Food_Court_Event"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Additional_Shared_Appearances"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Win_Her_a_Prize_.E2.80.94_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Win_Her_a_Prize_—_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Boardwalk_After_Sunset_.E2.80.94_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Boardwalk_After_Sunset_—_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Fair_Date_.E2.80.94_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Fair_Date_—_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Dates_and_Exact_Start_Windows"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-A_Claim_Answered"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-A_Larger_Night"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Shape_of_Appetite"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Heart-to-Hearts_and_Best_Replies"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Five_Minutes_of_Night_.E2.80.94_Seven_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Five_Minutes_of_Night_—_Seven_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Personal_and_Shared_Event_Gates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Torea 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/torea.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Torea 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/torea.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Torea 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Torea的普通会面在主线61后开放。个人路线交替使用现代白天场所与晚间房间，部分步骤也要求推进Helsa的路线；下文只列拜访条件与关系阶段，不展开她们的发现。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Stats.2C_Unlock_and_Daily_Schedule"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Stats,_Unlock_and_Daily_Schedule"></span><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>每天09:00—14:00可在大学教室、14:00—18:00在商场美食广场、18:00—23:00在Torea的房间、00:00—04:00在市中心后巷见她。四处普通头像均要求主线61完成；晚间房间可沿图书馆地下室路线进入。</p><p>晚间房间的路线是现代上城区 → 城市图书馆（上城区） → 图书馆地下室 → 黑暗走廊 → 吸血鬼巢穴 → Torea的房间；私人房间直接从巢穴主厅分出。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">大学教室</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">09:00–14:00</td><td data-label="条件">主线61完成后</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">美食广场（商场）</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">主线61完成后</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Torea的房间</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">主线61完成后</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">后巷</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">00:00–04:00</td><td data-label="条件">主线61完成后</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Route_Order"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>先在已遇见（10）时，于19:00—22:00进入房间推进霓虹中的狩猎，再于00:00—03:00到后巷继续。游园会约会要求朋友（100）及追猎来临，在学校11:00—14:00开始。</p><p>第一段谈心接在游园会之后，要求朋友关系。继续Torea与Helsa的共同个人目标，再推进休息室事件、第二段谈心与木板路约会。第三段谈心要求完成后期的共同夜间事件；下表分别保留各步骤的地点与时段。</p><details><summary>展开自动事件的完整开始条件</summary><p>在事件时段进入指定地点即可触发。均为一次性事件，下列固定基础关系奖励与选择奖励另算；未列额外时段表示事件本身不再加设时间限制。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">开始地点／时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">固定基础关系奖励</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">饥渴的形状</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">Carmilla的寝室; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Torea 相识（50）；完成：Carmilla夫人</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Lady Carmilla +5、Torea +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">霓虹中的狩猎</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">Torea的房间; 19:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">Torea 已遇见（10）；完成：主线61</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Torea +8</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">银之气息</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">后巷; 00:00–03:00</td><td data-label="条件">完成：霓虹中的狩猎</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Torea +10</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">放出那只猫</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">Torea的房间; 19:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">Torea 朋友（100）；Helsa 朋友（100）；完成：与 Torea 的嘉年华约会、Helsa的前一个人里程碑（见目标）、饥渴的形状、我所选择的猎人</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Torea +8、Helsa +8、Diedra +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">缎带系着獠牙</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">吸血鬼休息室; 18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">完成：放出那只猫</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Torea +14、Diedra +8、Lady Carmilla +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">血债与血之选择</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">Torea的房间; 19:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">Torea 亲密朋友（200）；完成：日落后的木板路、猎人也会流血、更广阔的夜；Becky当前可参加会面</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Torea +18、Helsa +6、Officer Becky +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">夜晚的五分钟</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">后巷; 21:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">Torea 亲密朋友（200）；Helsa 亲密朋友（200）；完成：血债与血之选择、她没有射出的那支箭、更广阔的夜、漫长的追猎</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Torea +25、Helsa +25</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">吸血鬼的占有宣言</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">Torea的房间; 19:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">Torea 浪漫感（800）；完成：夜晚的五分钟、一个被回应的宣言</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Torea +30</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">安静的一章</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">城市图书馆（上城区）; 08:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">完成：主线100</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">更甜美的东西</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">美食广场（商场）; 14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">Katie 朋友（100）；Torea 朋友（100）；完成：主线61</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">因果之窗</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">吸血鬼实验室; 不限时段</td><td data-label="条件">Torea 相识（50）；完成：导师Ruxandra</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Magistra Ruxandra +8、Torea +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">追猎来临</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">后巷; 01:00–04:00</td><td data-label="条件">完成：银之气息</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Helsa +10、Torea +3</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">怪物的研究者</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">大学大厅; 单数日，09:00–13:00</td><td data-label="条件">Helsa 已遇见（10）；完成：追猎来临</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Helsa +10、Torea +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">她没有射出的那支箭</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">后巷; 21:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">Helsa 亲密朋友（200）；完成：和Helsa一起观星、缎带系着獠牙、漫长的追猎</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Helsa +18、Torea +7</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">游园会约会</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学教室; 11:00–14:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：追猎来临</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富150；−45 精力</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">替她赢个奖品</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学教室; 12:00–14:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；当前未怀孕</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；兑换券 ×1</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">饥渴的形状</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Torea的房间; 18:00–23:00</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：与 Torea 的嘉年华约会</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">75分钟；−15 精力；+5 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">更广阔的夜</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Torea的房间; 20:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：缎带系着獠牙、饥渴的形状</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90分钟；−20 精力；+10 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">日落后的木板路</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Torea的房间; 18:00–20:00</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：缎带系着獠牙、更广阔的夜</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">120分钟；财富100；−35 精力；+10 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">一次性</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一个被回应的宣言</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">Torea的房间; 20:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400）；完成：夜晚的五分钟、更广阔的夜</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">90分钟；−15 精力；+15 镇定</td><td data-label="结果／限制">谈心，一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>交谈消耗20分钟，给予1点基础关系，四处地点共用每日3次安全额度。兑换券游园会是学校提供的另一项一次性约会，实际开始时间为12:00—14:00，不是整个下午。</p><p>三段谈心分别消耗75、90、90分钟，后两段晚间谈心在20:00—22:00开始。木板路约会从房间18:00—20:00发起，消耗120分钟、100财富、35精力，恢复10镇定。</p><p>主线61后，达到迷恋（400）也可在20:00—23:00从KTV或夜总会邀请Torea，各场所的全部来宾共用每日一次额度。这些邀请与个人约会链分开计算。</p><p>除注明直接增加外，关系奖励均为基础值，最终增量受共通关系修正影响。同一角色换地点不会重置重复动作的每日额度。</p><details><summary>展开关系加成参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">类别</th><th scope="col">参考</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">偏好属性</th><td data-label="参考">魅力 120、智力 130、神秘 110</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">关系加成技能</th><td data-label="参考">人类学</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>偏好属性的加成随数值提高，逐步达到所列参考值。关系加成技能影响共通关系倍率，不代表该角色一定负责教授这项技能。</p></details><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">和 Torea 交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">大学教室; 09:00–14:00<br/>美食广场（商场）; 14:00–18:00<br/>Torea的房间; 18:00–23:00<br/>后巷; 00:00–04:00</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+1；3次／日安全额度</td></tr></tbody></table></div><details><summary>展开谈心奖励参考</summary><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">谈心</th><th scope="col">最佳普通选择基础总值</th><th scope="col">实用特殊回复条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">饥渴的形状</th><td data-label="最佳普通选择基础总值">72</td><td data-label="实用特殊回复条件">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">更广阔的夜</th><td data-label="最佳普通选择基础总值">88</td><td data-label="实用特殊回复条件">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一个被回应的宣言</th><td data-label="最佳普通选择基础总值">108</td><td data-label="实用特殊回复条件">—</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>总值为普通选项的最佳基础合计，尚未套用关系修正。特殊回复可提高奖励，但不是完成谈心的必要条件；学会浪漫后，完成时另加25点最终关系。</p></details></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting_and_Current_Scope"></span><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>自动夜间事件的时段可能不同于后巷普通头像。缺少后续个人动作时，除了Torea的关系阶段，也要检查Helsa的当前目标与已完成谈心。</p></section>
